    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Yaaaaaaawn...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Huh? It’s already become so\n",
        "bright outside!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Yaaaaawn...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Huh? What?! Is it already that late?!\n",
        "Oh no! I overslept!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Hmm. Looks like the sun is descending\n",
        "in the sky...\r",
        "...So this would be what is called\n",
        "“twilight,” wouldn’t it?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Hmm... Interesting...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Huh? Oh! Excuse me, sorry!\n",
        "I was just reading this book here.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Yaaaaaaawn...\n",
        "...\r",
        "Huh? A guest?\n",
        "At this hour?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry to keep you waiting!\r",
        "Welcome to the world of Pokémon!\r",
        "My name is Professor Oak.\r",
        "But everyone calls me the\n",
        "Pokémon Professor.\r",
        "Before we go any further, I’d like to\n",
        "tell you a few things you should\f",
        "know about this world!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "I will first tell you important\n",
        "things about this game.\n",
        "\n",
        "Please touch any topic you’d like\n",
        "to know more about on the\n",
        "lower screen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00008",
      "garbage": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll explain this game’s controls.\n",
        "\n",
        "You can control this game by\n",
        "touching the lower screen, also\n",
        "called the Touch Screen.\n",
        "\n",
        "Please touch the panel in the\n",
        "bottom right of the Touch Screen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "By touching the Touch Screen\n",
        "like this, you can confirm\n",
        "selections and advance\n",
        "conversations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "You can also advance by pressing\n",
        "the A Button when you see the\n",
        "A Button icon on the Touch Screen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Different touch buttons will appear\n",
        "on the Touch Screen depending on\n",
        "the situation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, I’ll explain the button\n",
        "operations.\n",
        "\n",
        "You can move the main character\n",
        "around on the screen using the\n",
        "+Control Pad."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, I’ll explain about buttons.\n",
        "\n",
        "Use the +Control Pad to move\n",
        "the main character.\n",
        "\n",
        "You can also use the +Control\n",
        "Pad to select entries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "You can operate the screens using\n",
        "buttons instead of touching the\n",
        "Touch Screen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Used to confirm a choice, check\n",
        "things, chat, and scroll text.\n",
        "\n",
        "Used to exit, cancel a choice,\n",
        "and cancel a mode."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Use this to move within menus.\n",
        "\n",
        "Press to use a Key Item, such\n",
        "as a Bicycle, that has been\n",
        "registered in advance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00018",
      "garbage": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00019",
      "garbage": 34
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00020",
      "garbage": 107
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00021",
      "garbage": 56
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00022",
      "garbage": 69
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00023",
      "en_US": [
        "If this mark is shown in the\n",
        "message window, there are active\n",
        "buttons you can touch on the\n",
        "Touch Screen below."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00024",
      "garbage": 25
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00025",
      "en_US": "{YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00026",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you understand everything\n",
        "so far? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00027",
      "garbage": 33
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00028",
      "en_US": [
        "You are about to enter a world\n",
        "where you will embark on a grand\n",
        "adventure of your very own."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Speak to people and check things\n",
        "wherever you go, be it in towns,\n",
        "roads, or caves.\n",
        "Gather information and hints from\n",
        "every possible source."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "New paths will open to you when\n",
        "you help people in need, overcome\n",
        "challenges, and solve mysteries."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "At times, you will be challenged\n",
        "by others to a battle.\n",
        "At other times, wild creatures\n",
        "may stand in your way.\n",
        "\n",
        "By overcoming such hurdles,\n",
        "you will gain great power."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00032",
      "en_US": [
        "However, your adventure is not\n",
        "solely about becoming powerful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "On your travels, we hope that\n",
        "you will meet countless people\n",
        "and, through them, achieve\n",
        "personal growth.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is the most important\n",
        "objective of this adventure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "This world is widely inhabited by\n",
        "creatures known as Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "We humans live alongside Pokémon\n",
        "as friends.\r",
        "At times we play together, and at\n",
        "other times we work together.\r",
        "Some people use their Pokémon to\n",
        "battle and develop closer bonds\f",
        "with them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, why don’t you tell me a little bit\n",
        "about yourself?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you a boy?\n",
        "Or are you a girl?\f",
        "Won’t you please tell me? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00038",
      "en_US": "So, you’re a boy then? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00039",
      "en_US": "So, you’re a girl then? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00040",
      "en_US": "Please tell me your name."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00041",
      "en_US": "Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00042",
      "en_US": "Your name is {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0219_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Are you ready?\r",
        "Your very own tale of grand adventure\n",
        "is about to unfold.\r",
        "Fun experiences, difficult experiences,\n",
        "there’s so much waiting for you!\r",
        "Dreams! Adventure!\n",
        "Let’s go to the world of Pokémon!\r",
        "I’ll see you later!\r"
      ]
    },
